ot/issues/111129","id":3397759512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KhbIY","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-13T14:26:21Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T14:26:21Z","body":"Suggested name changes have been applied.\r\n\r\nPipeline free() logic has also been added wherever it's necessary. Also, I've reworked some of the copy pipelines arithmetic to just use a two-dimensional array which should be a bit easier to understand. There should be no difference to the structure packing internally.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3397759512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3399535016","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111129#issuecomment-3399535016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111129","id":3399535016,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KoMmo","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T00:35:50Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T00:35:50Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3399535016/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401588583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111129#issuecomment-3401588583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111129","id":3401588583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KwB9n","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T12:35:02Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T12:37:51Z","body":"> I do feel like we should eventually add a mechanism to do the free on a background thread. In a perfect world the free function would always return quickly without stalling.\r\n\r\nThe main problem here is that there's no guarantee to be able to do that because a shader could be freed while the pipeline that needs the SPIR-V is being built. There'd need to be some deeper mechanism built into RenderingDevice probably to be able to defer this in that way and decouple the SPIR-V's allocation from the Shader to allow the pipeline to finish compiling.\r\n\r\nIt is unlikely a driver doesn't use a copy of the data, but it's a race condition none the less.\r\n\r\nDrivers also are allowed to pull other bits of the shader using the RID during pipeline creation so it definitely needs to be kept alive, and if RenderingDevice isn't aware of the compilations currently in progress in the background, the safest way now is to indeed just free the pipeline before the shader, forcing the wait.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401588583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]